      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SSM-101 Remise II&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 1 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the SSM-1 body, which is a nimble space-superiority missile.  This missile will deliver a Proximity Fuze, High Explosive, Blast Fragmentation warhead.  It homes in on its target using an Active Radar seeker.  If the primary seeker does not find a target or is jammed, it can fall back on a Radar Home-on-Jam seeker.

$MISSILESTAT_CONTROLMETHOD: $MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_DIRECT
$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE: &lt;b&gt;&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_POS&lt;/color&gt;	&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_TRACK&lt;/color&gt;&lt;/b&gt;

$MISSILESTAT_PRIMARYSEEKER: $MISSILESEEKER_MODE_ACTIVE_CAPS &lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;
$MISSILESTAT_BACKUPSEEKER: HOME-ON-JAM (&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt; JAMMING Signals Only)

$MISSILESTAT_SPEED: 300 $UNIT_METERSPERSEC
$MISSILESTAT_DISTANCE: 5,893 $UNIT_METERS
$MISSILESTAT_TOPSPEEDTIME: 0.7 $UNIT_SECONDS
$MISSILESTAT_TURNRATE: 6.0 $UNIT_GS
$MISSILESTAT_TERMINALS: $MISSILESTAT_TERMINALS_NONE|None|

